  "summary": "An open common ringed by giant rotting trees burrowed out as homes, with a drum circle at its heart.",
  "text": "An open common ringed by giant rotting trees burrowed out as homes, with a drum circle at its heart. Spore clouds thicken the air until the far trees are only a rumour.",
